{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-11_end","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-10","title":"来到坟茔","storyCode":"16-11","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-11_end.txt","sourceHash":"73af1781f0df10b8a38b9181e96783d34e22427648fb5a5e135dc1c9f9ee2823","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"阿米娅等人来到经历火灾后的村庄，与Raidian小队会合。众人商量好了如何安置村民与留下的矿工。Raidian前去询问矿工们的想法，奇怪的情况却发生了。Mantra发现异样，介入调查。","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"脚印就到这里了，前面是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，我认为可以不用往前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里发生了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯远北地区</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个村庄距离矿工们抛下载具的地方最近，本来还想着能问下情况......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看现在这样，里面还有没有活人都不好说。从栅栏被烧毁的痕迹看，甚至应该就是不久前的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死......又迟了一步！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅继续往前走去，直到寂静的残垣在视野中变得更加清晰。\n曾燃起的大火早已熄灭，周围林中光秃的枝桠甚至无法遮蔽双月。在月光下，废墟枯黑，所见的一切都与想象中的村庄相去甚远。\n阿米娅记得，她曾见过类似的图景，也因此产生了瞬间的恍惚，还有担忧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra女士，我们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我带人去搜寻一下还有没有幸存者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，我们很快就回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，极境先生。我们都过去，直接分开找找看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我好像看到那边有人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，先生！我们是从附近来的救援队！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"您是这里的村民吗？请问您知不知道村子里发生了什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"该死！该死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"又来了！又来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我应该有说我是救援队吧？难道是我的乌萨斯语不标准？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他大概只是......害怕。我能感觉到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"但他会在这里出现，肯定就住在这附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办阿米娅，我们要不要跟上去瞧瞧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先不要贸然跟上去了，以免再次给他们造成惊吓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对、对不起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不是，故意，跟着你们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到，你们的衣服......和姐姐的，很像，就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"衣服很像？你是说这个图案吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（点头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的姐姐，叫什么名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞，塞拉菲娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这确实是Raidian的本名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"这个塞拉菲娜，是不是一位个子小小，有四只手的黎博利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......认识她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的！我们是她的同伴，我们一直在寻找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你又叫什么名字？你能不能......能不能带我们去见这位塞拉菲娜小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年感染者","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫......别乔克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，跟我走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里......发生了，火灾。留下来的人，都在，村子外面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐一直，帮我们。没有她，我们走不到......这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说，你们是从中心矿区来的矿工？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。现在，你们来了，还说帮忙。太好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这样，我们一定能，活下去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，到了。就在前面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谁......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕扬叔叔？你还在，发烧，不要坐在......门口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我没发烧，腿上烂掉的地方用衣服捆起来就不痛了，无所谓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？你又带来了谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们认识，塞拉菲娜姐姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我们和她的小队来自同一家医药公司，请相信我们没有恶意——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊讶的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......真的是你们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是怎么找过来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然真的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于找到你们了，Raidian！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她冲上去，抱住失联多日的同伴。\n阿米娅想过，也许不好在他人面前这样直接地表露自己的情绪，但现在，她没能拒绝这个放下心防的时机。\n没有什么比得上久别重逢的喜悦，也没有什么比得上见到牵挂的人安然无恙时那一刻的安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个女孩说起你的名字时，我还不敢确定，但现在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这真是最好的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian......你们怎么样？还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事......真抱歉，让你们担心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian小队全员共九人，现在归队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你们能找到这里......是有人发现了我沿路留下的痕迹？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聪明的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra！我就知道你一定也在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在发现你失联后，我们和博士，还有Mon3tr就一起赶来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士他们现在正在等待我们找到的那位研究员醒来，之后如果通讯能恢复，就会来和我们会合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？博士也来乌萨斯了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我们彼此应该都有很多问题要问......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......扑灭火灾之后，雷尔金带领另一部分人离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留在这里的，是一些不愿意，或者没有能力继续往前走的矿工，还有原本就住在这里的村民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很遗憾，没能提前阻止......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然还发生了这种事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位雷尔金先生，与整合运动有什么关联吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......就我了解的情况，他没有直接与整合运动取得联络，他只是相信在乌卡边境上，存在着一处整合运动的据点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这段时间里我也曾听远北的某些流亡感染者说起过类似的事情，罗德岛有得到任何相关的信息吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，所以你的意思是，这群人与整合运动完全无关，只是抓住了一面旗帜就盲目挥舞了起来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位新面孔是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿洛伊泽·戈尔奇科娃，近卫军前锋营中士。您可以叫我阿洛伊泽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫军为什么会出现在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位阿洛伊泽小姐帮助我们进入了矿区，她是为了调查中心矿区变异感染者的传闻而来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian小姐，很荣幸认识你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我由衷地为你们的重聚感到高兴——但时间紧迫，请允许我开门见山地问了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否在这一伙流亡的矿工中发现了变异感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"变异感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为罗德岛的干员，你应该了解的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......至少留在这里的没有。我的小队在为他们做检查的时候，没有发现所谓的变异感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就很奇怪了......这些人当中肯定有什么不对劲的地方，如果留下的人没有问题，那我们就得尽快赶上离开的那些了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们离开时有没有告诉过你，他们打算从什么路线去乌卡边境？或者有没有留下别的线索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我没有义务向你报告什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian小姐，请你相信，我来到这里，唯一的目的就是查明变异感染者风波的真相，尽可能地平息动乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣骏堡也是站在想要维护感染者利益的立场上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，尊敬的近卫军小姐。这些话在我听来丝毫没有说服力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在“塔什干矿场”，在“黑河监狱”......我可从来没有见过有哪一位贵族站出来维护“感染者的利益”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，竟然是第三集团军的人吗？......原来你也是一位乌萨斯人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很久以前就已经不是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......Raidian小姐，我相信你有充分的理由讨厌这个国家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但无论如何，我依然决心要为我的祖国效忠。你想要避免的事情，在另一种意义上，我也希望避免。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那伙离开这里的矿工，正在向南方行进，他们要去乌卡边境的话，无论如何都会先路过圣骏堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道他们是否意识到了这点，但只要被发现，不管目的究竟如何，他们都会被认作是一支胆敢向首都发起叛乱的队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......到那时候，等待他们的结局不会有第二种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿洛伊泽小姐，我以为您只是询问，而不是威胁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是陈述事实。如果这位朋友能够如实相告，那我也不用这么严肃。我需要知道这群矿工是怎么离开的，他们出逃的目的又是什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到这个时候还要有所隐瞒的话，对你，对他们，都不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只看到一群想要努力活下去的感染者，没有任何人可以站在任何立场对他们发起指控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，还是说不通吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅小姐，能否看在我们这一路同行的情分上，帮我劝说一下这位倔强的黎博利小姐呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请等一下，阿洛伊泽小姐。在此之前还有另一件更要紧的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留在这里的矿工和村民，还处在非常危险的状态。他们没有物资，无处可去，我们不能放任他们不管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要先确保他们的安全，才能谈下一步打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"村民不用你们考虑，我原本就打算事后为他们寻求援助，重建村庄——女大公在这些事情上一向慷慨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这些矿工，他们可不是写一纸说明就能解决的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您不愿意，那罗德岛会为他们提供帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为了我们的合作，我就再帮你们一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们带矿工去圣骏堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，主动去圣骏堡，先一步将这些矿工变为证人，之后就立刻向陛下禀报中心矿区感染者异变的始末与真相......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样圣骏堡就有理由庇护他们，也有理由拦截而非“剿灭”那些已经离开的人。这些措施至少能实施到针对女大公的调查结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那之后呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会去游说议长，请陛下赦免这些感染者，再以医疗协助的名义请罗德岛介入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......又或者，你只是现在需要这些矿工作为证人，等用他们扳倒女大公之后却不一定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否则你们没有任何放过这些感染者的理由。我了解乌萨斯，无论那位陛下想给这片冰冷的土地带去怎样的温暖......它都不会属于感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收回你的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我也只是“陈述事实”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么敢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——也许乌萨斯的确是这样，但我愿意相信阿洛伊泽小姐。我们一路以来的合作足以让我得出这样的判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米娅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，阿洛伊泽小姐。Raidian只是表达了她的担忧，相信我们都对乌萨斯在感染者问题上的态度有所了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（点头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，即使这只是对我个人......我得说，感谢信任。"},{"type":"narration","text":"近卫军动作夸张地向两人鞠了一躬，最后略带挑衅地看向了Raidian。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我也还有最后一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有做这些事的权限吗，“中士”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许是你离开圣骏堡太久了，还没有听说过“戈尔奇科娃”这个姓氏在圣骏堡的分量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以自己的家族起誓——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后面的事，除了提供医疗协助，别的都不需要你们担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你没说谎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但就算这样的方案可行，我们也需要先征求矿工们的同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，让我去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会去向他们说明情况，并询问他们的想法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别乔克，你在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们得告诉大家，我们现在有一个选择，离开这里，所有人一起去圣骏堡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣骏堡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈说......圣骏堡，街上种着，洋槐，和樱桃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天空，是，亮的。羽兽会，筑、筑巢，不会，飞走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那里有，春天。是，那个，圣骏堡吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，是那个圣骏堡。你想去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去！我想——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳！"},{"type":"narration","text":"她说得太急、太快，以至于喉咙呛入了冷气，开始因干燥而疼痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你想，但其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从没，离开，矿区。我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得问问其他人是不是也像你一样，愿意相信我们，愿意去圣骏堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去，我去问。一定、一定愿意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你......回来，之前，达雅说，我们走、走不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算想、想走，回矿区，外面的人，也会，来拦。他们要，把我们都......烧死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要，告诉她，不是、不是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，不是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达雅！达雅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达雅，我们一起，去，圣骏堡！姐姐有、有办法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，都......都去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......达雅？"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩靠墙坐得笔直，却没有任何反应。她闭着眼，倦意和枯槁像阴影一样爬满她年轻的面颊。\n她仍在呼吸，却只是在维持着最低限度的生存本能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不能......留在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我——走——我扶着，你！我可以，扶着你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达雅......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许她只是太累了，让她好好休息吧，我们先去找其他人——"},{"type":"narration","text":"别乔克环视四周，希望友人的沉默只是偶然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕扬叔叔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她走过去，依次摇晃每个人，却发现不知从什么时候开始，他们都已经僵硬地直起身来，就像达雅一样。\n他们有的跪着，有的站着，却无一例外都将身子虔诚地朝向屋内深处那位头颅低垂的老者，仿佛听不见其他任何的声音。\n别乔克抬头望去，一个称呼下意识地从口中滑出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......奶奶？"},{"type":"narration","text":"顺着别乔克惶惑的眼神，Raidian也抬头望去。\n在众人视线的尽头，苍老的声音环绕整个空间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾为乌萨斯铭记之人。"},{"type":"narration","text":"兜帽遮住了她的面容，也遮蔽了她的视线。但Raidian莫名觉得，那人的目光并不投向自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您在说什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉打扰，但你这样实在有点太慢咯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位！我现在有一个能尽量保障所有人安全的提议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“中士”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是跟我们离开远北，前往圣骏堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那里，帝国议会会为各位提供庇护，只要你们能站出来，作为证人指认女大公的罪行，配合针对她的调查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"皇帝陛下需要知道这里发生了什么，乌萨斯需要知道这里发生了什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而在一切尘埃落定之后，你们认识的这位女士，她所在的罗德岛，一家医药公司，将会为你们提供后续的医疗帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，愿意跟我离开的人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们根本没有听见你说的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些人身上的电信号......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"没有来源的森然冷意刺穿Raidian的大脑皮层，几乎将她钉在原地。\n她突然不愿继续开口示警，即使这本来是她上一秒要做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"再无序的电信号对她而言都向来温和，此刻她却不得不将其变为使自己清醒的锋利刀刃。\nRaidian调动源石技艺将自己全身麻痹，以求挣脱那无形也无来由的束缚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊泽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，你怎么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快——走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"马上——带所有人——离开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra女士，我感觉到寒冷和......痛苦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个漩涡，在邀请我踏入......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，不要去看，不要去听！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，马上用源石技艺暂时屏蔽自己的感官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"极境，你也一样。你们留在这里，我去探明情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra女士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要进来！这里的情况很奇怪，他们听不见我们说话——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它呼唤了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这就是我应该面对的。"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra闭眼，整个封闭空间开始以类似意识蓝图的形式在脑海中构筑。\n她踏入屋内，她要找到锚定这里每个活跃意识的点，唤醒他们，使他们“听见”。\n至少，本应如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i28"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......只有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沉默？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"红。\n刺目的红。\n和雪地中的热血一样的红色，从视网膜四周攀缘而上。\n而后，她睁开眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是忍受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是虔信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是痛苦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是灵魂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是灵魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是灵魂！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我忍耐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我相信！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我承受......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陛下在上——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<color=#FF4200>“圣愚在上！”</color>"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_401_elysm","aliases":["极境"]}]}
